	(text "BrewPi device config on all three: A0 chamber temp, pin 5 chamber heater (Act 1), pin 6 chamber cooler (Act 2), \"not inverted\" — a high closes the relay.\nHeater feeds are the 7.5 A fuses V3–V5 via strip 2; heater 0 V returns to the fuse block V−.  Pump 24 V comes via strip 3 and leaves on strip 4.\nHeat/cool relays: unitank-1 = 1/4, unitank-2 = 2/5, chronical = 3/6.  Unos left→right on the panel in that order." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 223.52 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f6afad9-802a-428f-80ae-cf51ccaf2248"))
